        "director_identity": "claude-sonnet-5-5 director, this session",
        "expected_visible_result": "Before the ticket prints the wok is empty, the burner is at pilot or off and the pass shelf has no plated food. The paid mark enters the printer slot, the lamp turns red and the ticket rises and hangs on the rail inside one held shot, and the finished ticket holds before the wok loads and flares. The tables in s1, s3 and s9 show empty plates and menus. In A the server's stride has planted feet or the figure is gone. In s9 the hand raises the phone, pauses and lowers it with no hunting brackets.",
